WEBVTT

00:00.267 --> 00:02.014
&lt;i>Previously on Two and a Half Men...&lt;/i>

00:03.585 --> 00:04.785
Hi Charlie.

00:06.100 --> 00:08.458
You should know that
I didn't come over to ruin your date.

00:08.658 --> 00:10.092
Really. Why did you come over?

00:10.292 --> 00:12.128
To tell you that I'm getting married.

00:13.064 --> 00:14.397
Today's the big day, huh?

00:14.398 --> 00:16.249
Oh, please.
There's no wedding.

00:16.250 --> 00:17.700
Would it make
a difference to you,

00:17.701 --> 00:19.252
knowing that cute little face

00:19.253 --> 00:21.638
will never pop up
over that railing again?

00:21.639 --> 00:24.774
That the one woman who's always
loved you and been there for you

00:24.775 --> 00:27.227
is forever out of reach?

00:27.228 --> 00:28.544
Come on.

00:28.545 --> 00:29.946
Where are we going?

00:29.947 --> 00:31.414
To the church.
I'm going to prove to you

00:31.415 --> 00:32.482
that she's not getting married.

00:32.483 --> 00:35.485
Look. Tell me if
you see a wedding.

00:37.071 --> 00:39.089
I see a wedding.

00:39.090 --> 00:41.491
OFFICIANT: Two persons
present now come to be joined.

00:41.492 --> 00:43.626
Rose and Manfred...

00:43.627 --> 00:45.595
She's really doing it.

00:45.596 --> 00:50.166
...let him speak now,
or forever hold his peace.

00:50.167 --> 00:53.003
And we're clear.

00:53.004 --> 00:54.921
Yep, that ought to do it.

00:54.922 --> 00:56.439
Thanks, Freddie.

00:56.440 --> 00:58.475
♪ Men. ♪

01:00.511 --> 01:03.113
Eenie, meenie, miney, moe.

01:03.114 --> 01:05.448
Catch a tiger...

01:05.449 --> 01:06.850
Oh, who am I kidding?

01:06.851 --> 01:08.685
I love you all.

01:10.688 --> 01:12.689
Let's see. What else do we need?

01:12.690 --> 01:14.624
Oh, right. Ice.

01:14.625 --> 01:17.894
Water in a useful form.

01:17.895 --> 01:20.630
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Everybody all right?

01:20.631 --> 01:21.831
Charlie?

01:21.832 --> 01:23.867
Rose?

01:23.868 --> 01:25.735
What a nice surprise.

01:25.736 --> 01:26.836
(smooches)

01:26.837 --> 01:27.971
How are you?
Good. Good. Good.

01:27.972 --> 01:29.039
You look great.

01:29.040 --> 01:31.307
Oh, thank you.
Married life agrees with me.

01:31.308 --> 01:32.992
Oh, that's right.
Congratulations.

01:32.993 --> 01:34.144
So where are
you living now?

01:34.145 --> 01:36.312
Uh, Manny and I moved
into my beach house.

01:36.313 --> 01:37.797
Oh, so we'll be
neighbors again.

01:37.798 --> 01:39.616
Yeah.
I'll have to come by
and meet him sometime.

01:39.617 --> 01:41.484
I don't think
that's a good idea.

01:41.485 --> 01:43.803
The old boyfriend
meeting the new husband.

01:43.804 --> 01:45.004
It's a little awkward.

01:45.005 --> 01:46.222
Yeah, I guess you're right.

01:46.223 --> 01:48.425
I've never been that
popular with husbands.

01:48.426 --> 01:50.760
Or fathers.

01:50.761 --> 01:52.629
Or boyfriends. Sons.

01:52.630 --> 01:54.531
Surly lesbian roommates.

01:54.532 --> 01:56.566
(sighs)
So, anyway, you're happy?

01:56.567 --> 01:58.635
More than I ever
dreamed possible.

01:58.636 --> 02:00.970
You know what he said
to me the other day?

02:00.971 --> 02:04.774
Without me at his side,
he might as well not exist.

02:06.444 --> 02:09.579
Wow. That's a little gay,
but all right.

02:09.580 --> 02:11.214
What about you, Charlie?

02:11.215 --> 02:12.816
Is there anyone
special in your life?

02:12.817 --> 02:16.202
No. Not really. I mean, there's
gals with special skills,

02:16.203 --> 02:17.537
but I got to pay extra.

02:17.538 --> 02:19.556
You should find
someone who loves you

02:19.557 --> 02:20.874
the way Manny loves me.

02:20.875 --> 02:23.993
The love is the same.
It's just at an hourly rate.

02:23.994 --> 02:26.229
Don't grow old alone, Charlie.

02:26.230 --> 02:27.430
Right.

02:28.933 --> 02:30.600
Bye.
Bye.

02:35.206 --> 02:36.973
What is it with women?

02:36.974 --> 02:38.575
They go off and get married,

02:38.576 --> 02:40.860
and all of a sudden seem
a lot more beautiful.

02:42.847 --> 02:46.549
Ah, no matter, MacTavich.
We can grow old together.

02:48.419 --> 02:51.287
After all, you're only 20.

02:51.288 --> 02:54.057
But I doubt you're gonna see 21.

02:54.058 --> 02:56.876
♪ Men, men, men, men, manly men,
men, men ♪

02:56.877 --> 03:00.130
♪ Men, men, men, men,
manly men, men, men ♪
♪ Ooh ♪

03:00.131 --> 03:03.299
♪ Men, men, men, men,
manly men ♪
♪ Ooh ♪
♪ Ooh ♪

03:03.300 --> 03:05.418
♪ Ooh-ooh-ooh,
ooh-ohh, ooh-ooh... ♪

03:05.419 --> 03:07.937
♪ Men, men, men, men, manly men,
men, men ♪

03:07.938 --> 03:10.974
♪ Ooh ♪
♪ Men, men, men, men, manly men,
men, men ♪

03:10.975 --> 03:13.669
♪ Ah. ♪
♪ Men. ♪
♪ Men. ♪

03:13.769 --> 03:17.269
&lt;font color="#00ff00">♪ Two and a Half Men 8x14 ♪&lt;/font>
&lt;font color="#00ffff">Lookin' for Japanese Subs&lt;/font>
